                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p>This is a preliminary description: Survey of Kenniswijk ( designated regions in the Dutch cities of Eindhoven and Helmond), aimed at describing the use of information- and communication technology ( ICT ) in relation with themes like: involvement with neighbourhood, ways of spending leisure time, mobility, work, education and learning, consumptive behaviour and use of services. For further information, see also :  http://www.kenniswijk.nl</p>"
